m/video/BV1oupi6HEtw?share_source=copy_web\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oupi6HEtw?share_source=copy_web</a></p>\n<h2>下载地址</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id6806215315\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id6806215315</a></p>\n<h2>主要信息</h2>\n<p>应用名字：《水浒卡》</p>\n<p>做了哪些工作？</p>\n<p>1 、对卡图进行了高清化，基本可以做到 100%还原细节</p>\n<p>2 、在手机上还原了“粗闪”闪卡效果</p>\n<h3>送码</h3>\n<p>App 本身是免费的，不用内购也能玩，就是每天有拆卡次数限制。</p>\n<p>为了给自己打造一点人气，回帖的兄弟，给价值 68 元的内购码</p>\n<p>3 、添加了一些玩法，主要是拆卡包</p>\n", "last_modified": 1791615583, "replies": 93, "id": 1247629}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242147, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4528, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 604449, "username": "ShiBuYi", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/ShiBuYi", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_mini.png?m=1790043221", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_normal.png?m=1790043221", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_large.png?m=1790043221", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_xlarge.png?m=1790043221", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_xxlarge.png?m=1790043221", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_xxxlarge.png?m=1790043221", "created": 1669943889, "last_modified": 1790043221, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Voren", "last_touched": 1791632237, "title": "有男的脱毛过吗？想把腹毛脱了，有没有过来人请教下", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247556", "created": 1791601650, "deleted": 0, "content": "腹毛挡我腹肌了。\r\n不好看。想脱了。", "content_rendered": "<p>腹毛挡我腹肌了。\n不好看。想脱了。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1791601650, "replies": 57, "id": 1247556}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24539, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3749, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 658033, "username": "sh537612856486", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/sh537612856486", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6de/e7ac/658033_mini.png?m=1791623129", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6de/e7ac/658033_normal.png?m=1791623129", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6de/e7ac/658033_large.png?m=1791623129", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6de/e7ac/658033_xlarge.png?m=1791623129", "created": 1698837763, "last_modified": 1791623129, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "apuslilie", "last_touched": 1791685573, "title": "AI 时代为什么硬件工程师反而不焦虑", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247677", "created": 1791623286, "deleted": 0, "content": "各个论坛都是讨论 IT 行业何去何从，反而很少看到硬件工程师吐槽的，有 V 友是硬件工程师，能谈下吗", "content_rendered": "<p>各个论坛都是讨论 IT 行业何去何从，反而很少看到硬件工程师吐槽的，有 V 友是硬件工程师，能谈下吗</p>\n", "last_modified": 1791677173, "replies": 48, "id": 1247677}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 73779, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9795, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 825866, "username": "wises", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/wises", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f3cd7b451651e027df6fae684d587b78?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f3cd7b451651e027df6fae684d587b78?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f3cd7b451651e027df6fae684d587b78?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1782830370, "last_modified": 1787923151, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "hronro", "last_touched": 1791671416, "title": "那些托管在国外的真正家庭中的机器（mac mini/主机）用 claude 真的会封吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247639", "created": 1791617139, "deleted": 0, "content": "我已经在越南朋友家里托管了一台主机，debian13 +桌面， 开放了 dmz, 除了平时可以做梯子，现在用上了远程桌面 + 开发， 用的是越南人的邮箱/绑定的支付，没遇到 kyc 的弹窗。 目前是第三天， 暂时 Claude 没封号，并且 Pro 感觉比之前 5x 更好用，更快，感觉 9 月 26 号之后，opus5.5 越来越聪明。\r\n\r\n\r\n我看到有人说在美国托管的 mac mini 也被封号了， 我很怀疑并想探讨下： 这是做中转站小子们散布的谣言吗？ 还是说是有， 但是是非常少的情况，可能真的是实际性的滥用导致， 比如开 team 账号卖。\r\n\r\n\r\n越南的网络让我感觉到了 2010 年前的中国互联网， 没太多的限制（特别今年以来，很多地方开启了 ipv6 ，速度更快，比我 2024 年前去的时候更快）， 反观国内的互联网现在已经被资本家 + 权贵代言人们折腾的成什么样子了。\r\n\r\n广西/广东/云南的朋友可以考虑托管机器到越南，如果 anthropic 一直这么封号的话。", "content_rendered": "我已经在越南朋友家里托管了一台主机，debian13 +桌面， 开放了 dmz, 除了平时可以做梯子，现在用上了远程桌面 + 开发， 用的是越南人的邮箱/绑定的支付，没遇到 kyc 的弹窗。 目前是第三天， 暂时 Claude 没封号，并且 Pro 感觉比之前 5x 更好用，更快，感觉 9 月 26 号之后，opus5.5 越来越聪明。<br /><br /><br />我看到有人说在美国托管的 mac mini 也被封号了， 我很怀疑并想探讨下： 这是做中转站小子们散布的谣言吗？ 还是说是有， 但是是非常少的情况，可能真的是实际性的滥用导致， 比如开 team 账号卖。<br /><br /><br />越南的网络让我感觉到了 2010 年前的中国互联网， 没太多的限制（特别今年以来，很多地方开启了 ipv6 ，速度更快，比我 2024 年前去的时候更快）， 反观国内的互联网现在已经被资本家 + 权贵代言人们折腾的成什么样子了。<br /><br />广西/广东/云南的朋友可以考虑托管机器到越南，如果 anthropic 一直这么封号的话。", "last_modified": 1791617139, "replies": 41, "id": 1247639}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24539, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3749, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 789000, "username": "1300296933", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/1300296933", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aa53e059dba7bdd5071f8751fc50dc96?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aa53e059dba7bdd5071f8751fc50dc96?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aa53e059dba7bdd5071f8751fc50dc96?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1770963573, "last_modified": 1788838673, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "akiyamamio", "last_touched": 1791666209, "title": "怎么感觉自己变不成一个大人", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247655", "created": 1791619525, "deleted": 0, "content": "入职了快两个月了，感觉做事方式还是很学生，沟通啥的也不能很顺畅，已经努力再做了，但感觉做的也是勉勉强强，尤其是活，感觉干不完一样的，然后有时候活还安排不过来，一点一点积压起来搞得喘不过气，被人找了也没有什么把握，调个 bug 没思路了也不知道怎么办，一想到自己又是个臭开发仔，过不了两年就给 ai 淘汰了，感觉干的好 down😢", "content_rendered": "入职了快两个月了，感觉做事方式还是很学生，沟通啥的也不能很顺畅，已经努力再做了，但感觉做的也是勉勉强强，尤其是活，感觉干不完一样的，然后有时候活还安排不过来，一点一点积压起来搞得喘不过气，被人找了也没有什么把握，调个 bug 没思路了也不知道怎么办，一想到自己又是个臭开发仔，过不了两年就给 ai 淘汰了，感觉干的好 down😢", "last_modified": 1791677369, "replies": 35, "id": 1247655}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11853, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2508, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 589794, "username": "canbewrong", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/canbewrong", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb6/d4a5/589794_mini.png?m=1660731939", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb6/d4a5/589794_normal.png?m=1660731939", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb6/d4a5/589794_large.png?m=1660731939", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb6/d4a5/589794_xlarge.png?m=1660731939", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb6/d4a5/589794_xxlarge.png?m=1660731939", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb6/d4a5/589794_xxxlarge.png?m=1660731939", "created": 1659317123, "last_modified": 1660731939, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "LandCruiser", "last_touched": 1791642133, "title": "医院和医院还真不一样", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247601", "created": 1791611311, "deleted": 0, "content": "早些年 我在湘雅做过一个小手术，\r\n肩膀有个小硬块，一厘米大小，就手术切掉。\r\n术后没打点滴，没后续检查（就切下来的东西做个活检），走路也不受影响。\r\n除了换纱布，其他时候就躺着发呆。\r\n躺了一个礼拜左右，我受不了了，反复要求出院，主治大夫还一个劲劝我不要出院。\r\n\r\n这几天，我家里人腰椎做手术，切个硬块，还打钢钉，\r\n到现在术后第四天，\r\n起床都要两个人搀着，\r\n大夫说“ct 拍了没问题，后续没治疗了，卧床一个月，今天出院吧”。\r\n\r\n我都惊了。\r\n按我上次的经验，我以为起码得在医院里躺半个月。\r\n结果直接让回家了。\r\n\r\n病房里三张床空了两张，这医院这是有钱都不赚啊。\r\n（不评价两家的医术，但光这一点，我真觉得差别有点大）", "content_rendered": "早些年 我在湘雅做过一个小手术，<br />肩膀有个小硬块，一厘米大小，就手术切掉。<br />术后没打点滴，没后续检查（就切下来的东西做个活检），走路也不受影响。<br />除了换纱布，其他时候就躺着发呆。<br />躺了一个礼拜左右，我受不了了，反复要求出院，主治大夫还一个劲劝我不要出院。<br /><br />这几天，我家里人腰椎做手术，切个硬块，还打钢钉，<br />到现在术后第四天，<br />起床都要两个人搀着，<br />大夫说“ct 拍了没问题，后续没治疗了，卧床一个月，今天出院吧”。<br /><br />我都惊了。<br />按我上次的经验，我以为起码得在医院里躺半个月。<br />结果直接让回家了。<br /><br />病房里三张床空了两张，这医院这是有钱都不赚啊。<br />（不评价两家的医术，但光这一点，我真觉得差别有点大）", "last_modified": 1791611311, "replies": 34, "id": 1247601}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_large.png?m=1660301119", "name": "create", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_normal.png?m=1660301119", "title": "分享创造", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/create", "topics": 37507, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎你在这里发布自己的最新作品！", "title_alternative": "Create", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119", "stars": 6221, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 17, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 837170, "username": "aixnode350", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/aixnode350", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4066/8e7f/837170_mini.png?m=1786547511", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4066/8e7f/837170_normal.png?m=1786547511", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4066/8e7f/837170_large.png?m=1786547511", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4066/8e7f/837170_xlarge.png?m=1786547511", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4066/8e7f/837170_xxlarge.png?m=1786547511", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4066/8e7f/837170_xxxlarge.png?m=1786547511", "created": 1786368723, "last_modified": 1786547511, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "qiuqiuqiuqiu", "last_touched": 1791659763, "title": "[天外 AI | 低价易得，稳定难求] 福利送码$5", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247696", "created": 1791628755, "deleted": 0, "content": "市面上做 AI 接入的中转站很多，但真正能长期稳定用、账单清楚、状态透明的并不多。\r\n\r\nTianWaiAI 稳定自用很久，现已小范围对外运营一段时间，最近新增加了 Claude/GPT 和国内最新模型，\r\n主要面向需要接 Claude / GPT 的开发者、AI Agent 、自动化脚本和小团队。\r\n\r\n网站： https://tianwaiai.com/\r\n\r\n平台核心能力：\r\n\r\n✅ 热门模型价格：\r\n\r\ngpt-6.1-sol\t        0.05 倍率\t0.10 输入/0.50 输出\r\n\r\nclaude-sonnet-5-5\t0.09 倍率\t0.18 输入/0.90 输出\r\n\r\ndeepseek-v4.1-flash\t0.05 倍率\t0.05 输入/0.20 输出\r\n\r\ngrok-4.7\t        0.06 倍率\t0.12 输入/0.36 输出\r\n\r\n✅ 公开价格页，方便直接比价\r\nhttps://tianwaiai.com/pricing\r\n\r\n\r\n✅ 实时消费明细\r\nhttps://tianwaiai.com/dashboard/overview\r\n\r\n\r\n🎁 新用户注册，回帖留 ID ，我发试用码", "content_rendered": "<p>市面上做 AI 接入的中转站很多，但真正能长期稳定用、账单清楚、状态透明的并不多。</p>\n<p>TianWaiAI 稳定自用很久，现已小范围对外运营一段时间，最近新增加了 Claude/GPT 和国内最新模型，\n主要面向需要接 Claude / GPT 的开发者、AI Agent 、自动化脚本和小团队。</p>\n<p>网站： <a href=\"https://tianwaiai.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tianwaiai.com/</a></p>\n<p>平台核心能力：</p>\n<p>✅ 热门模型价格：</p>\n<p>gpt-6.1-sol\t        0.05 倍率\t0.10 输入/0.50 输出</p>\n<p>claude-sonnet-5-5\t0.09 倍率\t0.18 输入/0.90 输出</p>\n<p>deepseek-v4.1-flash\t0.05 倍率\t0.05 输入/0.20 输出</p>\n<p>grok-4.7\t        0.06 倍率\t0.12 输入/0.36 输出</p>\n<p>✅ 公开价格页，方便直接比价\n<a href=\"https://tianwaiai.com/pricing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tianwaiai.com/pricing</a></p>\n<p>✅ 实时消费明细\n<a href=\"https://tianwaiai.com/dashboard/overview\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tianwaiai.com/dashboard/overview</a></p>\n<p>🎁 新用户注册，回帖留 ID ，我发试用码</p>\n", "last_modified": 1791628755, "replies": 29, "id": 1247696}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_large.png?m=1751736790", "name": "claude", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_normal.png?m=1751736790", "title": "Claude", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/claude", "topics": 999, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Claude", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_mini.png?m=1751736790", "stars": 748, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1148, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 781508, "username": "congminhcap246", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/congminhcap246", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b22a8779fe85cefbbb916d243a00b07?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b22a8779fe85cefbbb916d243a00b07?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b22a8779fe85cefbbb916d243a00b07?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1767093969, "last_modified": 1791614139, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "licoycn", "last_touched": 1791632897, "title": "Claude 2026 年 1-6 月封了 1140 万账号，其中只有有 4.2 万账号申诉成功", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247620", "created": 1791614211, "deleted": 0, "content": "在最近的更新公告中，Anthropic 在公告中专门设置了 Clarifying our Supported Regions Policy 一节，明确将以下情况纳入限制范围（禁止使用）：\r\n1. 人员实际位于中国大陆等不支持地区\r\n2. 公司注册于不支持地区\r\n3. 公司总部位于不支持地区\r\n4. 海外公司由不支持地区个人或实体多数持有\r\n5. 海外公司受到上述个人或实体控制\r\n\r\n这些政策将会在 2026 年 11 月 12 日生效，到时候估计又是一轮大逃杀\r\n![https://picui.ogmua.cn/s1/2026/10/10/6ac9dc9fe069c.webp]( https://picui.ogmua.cn/s1/2026/10/10/6ac9dc9fe069c.webp)", "content_rendered": "<p>在最近的更新公告中，Anthropic 在公告中专门设置了 Clarifying our Supported Regions Policy 一节，明确将以下情况纳入限制范围（禁止使用）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>人员实际位于中国大陆等不支持地区</li>\n<li>公司注册于不支持地区</li>\n<li>公司总部位于不支持地区</li>\n<li>海外公司由不支持地区个人或实体多数持有</li>\n<li>海外公司受到上述个人或实体控制</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这些政策将会在 2026 年 11 月 12 日生效，到时候估计又是一轮大逃杀\n<img alt=\"https://picui.ogmua.cn/s1/2026/10/10/6ac9dc9fe069c.webp\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://picui.ogmua.cn/s1/2026/10/10/6ac9dc9fe069c.webp\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1791614211, "replies": 25, "id": 1247620}]